.\specs\stories\code-review\gdx-3-mobile-touch-targets-codex-run.log:20104:+- **Observable consequence**: `components.css` is shared, but `.edit-tab` currently renders only in the player/game app. The comment's reason for locating the rule in the shared stylesheet (that it also renders on `admin.html`) is stale or false, which can misdirect future blast-radius analysis; no current admin layout regression was found from either changed `components.css` selector.
